{%- doc -%}
  Prints where photo swatches should zoom in, by product type.
  'body' for tall products whose print sits on the lower body (bottles, cups),
  'center' for everything else. Add a product type here to change its swatches.

  @param {object} product - The product.
{%- enddoc -%}
{%- liquid
  case product.type
    when 'Baby Bottles', 'Cups & Sippy Cups'
      echo 'body'
    else
      echo 'center'
  endcase
-%}
